{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/b7fd9319fe8e4993a35893e9b8583ad0.avif?t=1772955128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras_big/b7fd9319fe8e4993a35893e9b8583ad0.avif?t=1772955128 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/86db72dd5402fa38a0faa2c2092de36f.webp?t=1772955128\" width=628 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1772955128\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1772955128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1772955128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start in your garage with nothing but a crappy laptop, a few ideas, and dreams of becoming the next indie legend. Your goal: grow into a powerhouse studio making billion-dollar AAA games... or absolute dumpster fires with cult followings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/86db72dd5402fa38a0faa2c2092de36f.webp?t=1772955128\" width=628 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/172a07b31bdf5622e8372f8c5387c74d.webp?t=1772955128\" width=628 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting out in your garage with nothing but a beat-up laptop and big dreams, you set out to build your studio from the ground up \u2014 one game at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/86db72dd5402fa38a0faa2c2092de36f.webp?t=1772955128\" width=628 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/2d7783553a51a3e738b1887075b232d9.webp?t=1772955128\" width=628 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your studio grows, you\u2019ll start hiring employees\u2014each with their own skills and quirks\u2014to help turn your ideas into reality. Managing your team becomes just as important as making games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/86db72dd5402fa38a0faa2c2092de36f.webp?t=1772955128\" width=628 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/3dc3d3d35544976e816e81427a9dbcf4.webp?t=1772955128\" width=628 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your studio from a cramped garage to a high-tech headquarters. Invest in better equipment, bigger spaces, and cool perks to boost your team\u2019s creativity and output.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/86db72dd5402fa38a0faa2c2092de36f.webp?t=1772955128\" width=628 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/e3506010dcade0c01359b68dbdfc01c8.webp?t=1772955128\" width=628 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face fierce rivals as you climb the industry ladder. Outsmart, out-create, and out-hustle the competition to make your studio the biggest name in gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/86db72dd5402fa38a0faa2c2092de36f.webp?t=1772955128\" width=628 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/extras/2f5758996b69210f374f4def3fd2296c.webp?t=1772955128\" width=628 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with sharp humor and playful satire, <i>Startup!</i> pokes fun at the ups and downs of indie game development \u2014 from chaotic crunch times to bizarre design choices and everything in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761840?t=1772955128","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/d18c34aa2f848b7b3917bec1349df624a89d88b0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772955128","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/461117f8abe85b8920508530c7678e75b5c241ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772955128","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761840/461117f8abe85b8920508530c7678e75b5c241ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772955128","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.aka